### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@username = jankowalski

# Paste a Clerk JWT here (see README "Getting a token").
# Token expires after ~60s of inactivity in Clerk dev tier — refresh as needed.
@token = paste-clerk-jwt-here


### ==========================================
### PUBLIC PROFILE (no auth required)
### ==========================================

### Get public profile by username
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/p/{{username}}
Accept: application/json

### Send contact message to a profile
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/p/{{username}}/contact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tester",
  "email": "tester@example.com",
  "message": "Hi, I'd like to talk about a project."
}

### Get public availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/p/{{username}}/availability
Accept: application/json

### List all profiles (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profiles?page=0&size=12
Accept: application/json


### ==========================================
### MY PROFILE (requires Clerk JWT)
### ==========================================

### Get my profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Create profile (first time setup)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jankowalski",
  "displayName": "Jan Kowalski",
  "bio": "Full-stack developer helping startups build products",
  "location": "Warsaw",
  "websiteUrl": "https://jankowalski.dev"
}

### Update profile (partial)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Updated bio",
  "themeColor": "#7C3AED"
}

### Get my stats (views, services count, links count, contacts, bookings…)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json


### ==========================================
### SERVICES
### ==========================================

### Get my services
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Add service
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "1h Consultation",
  "description": "We discuss your project or technical problem",
  "price": 300.00,
  "currency": "PLN",
  "priceLabel": "/ hour"
}

### Update service (replace UUID)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/me/services/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 350.00
}

### Reorder services (provide all ids in desired order)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/services/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ids": [
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"
  ]
}

### Delete service (replace UUID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/me/services/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ==========================================
### LINKS
### ==========================================

### Get my links
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/links
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Add link
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/links
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "GitHub",
  "url": "https://github.com/jankowalski",
  "iconName": "github"
}

### Reorder links
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/links/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ids": [
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
    "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"
  ]
}

### Delete link (replace UUID)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/me/links/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ==========================================
### EMAIL DIAGNOSTICS
### ==========================================

### Send test email to logged-in user's address
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/email/test
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ==========================================
### TEST FLOW
### 1. POST /api/me/profile           -> creates user + profile
### 2. POST /api/me/services          -> adds services
### 3. POST /api/me/links             -> adds links
### 4. GET  /api/p/jankowalski        -> public view (verifies save)
### 5. POST /api/p/jankowalski/contact -> sends a message (records CONTACT event)
### 6. GET  /api/me/stats             -> see contactCount / bookingCount
### ==========================================
